What Challenges Could Restrict Adoption?

High equipment costs, limited content availability, system complexity and differences in display architecture may slow broader deployment. Buyers must also consider viewing conditions, installation space, service requirements and compatibility with existing digital systems.

The market's long-term growth will depend on whether suppliers can convert demonstration projects into repeatable commercial installations with measurable customer value.

